      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-25/tribal-voting-advocates-cite-harms-in-federal-election-bill</link>
      <description>What's known as the SAVE America Act would require an in-person verification of a U.S. passport or birth certificate when registering to vote in federal elections. Voters would also have to show a valid photo ID when it comes time to cast their ballot.</description>
